[{"title":"登下埔金龙山寺","author":"张天赋","text":"花含久蕊逐时开，笑侣登高一放怀。\n晚景未应嫌路远，举头咫尺是天台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3775,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"歇皂口驿","author":"张天赋","text":"十八滩头乱石多，舟穿石罅似抛梳。\n夕阳皂口沙边宿，风送渔郎欸乃歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3776,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过泰和张家湾","author":"张天赋","text":"斯渡名高景亦佳，乾坤今古有张家。\n隔江突兀康王庙，画栋凌空映彩霞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3777,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿花石巡检司","author":"张天赋","text":"宋室谁兴花石纲，奸臣不管国将亡。\n泊舟闻说名花石，仓卒令人倍感伤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3778,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过吉安府","author":"张天赋","text":"仰止西江文献邦，环城一带水悠长。\n暖风远扑游人笑，犹有当年翰墨香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3779,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江西城下舟中谈宸濠时事","author":"张天赋","text":"半溪移棹动天云，望里楼台已断魂。\n当日临流腾战马，至今谁为□□□。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3780,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"芜湖□□□□□","author":"张天赋","text":"天遣游人到□□，□□□□□